WEBVTT

00:44:28.625 --> 00:44:31.583
And boy, did they never think
that they survived on their own.

00:44:32.333 --> 00:44:36.768
So this notion of self-made
never existed for us.

00:44:36.792 --> 00:44:38.101
You are never self-made.

00:44:38.125 --> 00:44:39.809
You are made by the luck

00:44:39.833 --> 00:44:42.226
and the presence
of everything else in the moment.

00:44:42.250 --> 00:44:44.476
I think that's where my notion
of the both end

00:44:44.500 --> 00:44:49.351
and the multiplicity of things
is so woven into the way I look at things.

00:44:49.375 --> 00:44:50.643
And I live with that.

00:44:50.667 --> 00:44:53.309
I completely believe
in a communal structure,

00:44:53.333 --> 00:44:55.851
and I depend on a lot of people
for a lot of things,

00:44:55.875 --> 00:44:58.934
for me, for my kids,
for my team, for, you know,

00:44:58.958 --> 00:45:03.518
I'm constantly networking
before the word ever existed.